<section class="decision-story wrap" id="decision-story" aria-labelledby="decision-heading">
  <header class="decision-heading">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">从一个实际问题开始</span><h2 id="decision-heading">下一轮实验，先验证哪组配方？</h2></div>
    <span class="tag">水性涂料 · 示例说明</span>
  </header>
  <div class="decision-map">
    <div class="decision-purpose">
      <span class="step-label">01 / 明确目的</span>
      <h3>选下一步，先定标准。</h3>
      <p>想选出值得继续验证的配方，先说清楚要看哪些指标。</p>
      <dl class="criteria"><div><dt>粘度</dt><dd>95–105 KU</dd></div><div><dt>对比率</dt><dd>≥ 0.93</dd></div><div><dt>耐擦洗</dt><dd>≥ 5000 次</dd></div></dl>
    </div>
    <div class="decision-structure">
      <span class="step-label">02 / 用本体组织依据</span>
      <h3>哪组配方，做了哪次实验，测出了什么。</h3>
      <div class="object-chain" aria-label="配方关联实验批次，实验批次关联实测结果">
        <div><small>配方</small><strong>F-03</strong></div><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><div><small>实验批次</small><strong>B-1024</strong></div><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><div><small>实测结果</small><strong>2 项已测</strong></div>
      </div>
      <p>本体把配方、批次和指标连起来，让资料对应到具体对象，按同一套标准比较。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="decision-evidence">
    <div class="evidence-title"><div><span class="step-label">03 / 对照证据</span><h3>哪些达到目标，哪些还缺数据。</h3></div><a href="#decision-sources">查看示例依据 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="evidence-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="配方实测对比表，可横向滚动">
      <table><caption class="sr-only">三项指标的示例对比，不代表配方整体合格</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">配方 / 批次</th><th scope="col">粘度 <small>KU</small></th><th scope="col">对比率</th><th scope="col">耐擦洗 <small>次</small></th><th scope="col">核对结果</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody><tr><th scope="row">F-02 <small>B-1022</small></th><td data-label="粘度 / KU">99</td><td data-label="对比率">0.93</td><td data-label="耐擦洗 / 次">5200</td><td data-label="核对结果"><span class="result-pass">三项达到目标</span></td></tr><tr class="focus-row"><th scope="row">F-03 <small>B-1024</small></th><td data-label="粘度 / KU">103</td><td data-label="对比率">0.95</td><td data-label="耐擦洗 / 次"><span class="result-missing">未测</span></td><td data-label="核对结果">还缺耐擦洗结果</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">F-04 <small>B-1027</small></th><td data-label="粘度 / KU"><span class="result-missing">112</span></td><td data-label="对比率">0.94</td><td data-label="耐擦洗 / 次">6100</td><td data-label="核对结果">粘度高于目标</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
    <details id="decision-sources"><summary>依据来自哪里</summary><p>目标.md 给出三项指标的范围；实验记录 / 批次记录.csv 给出各批次实测值。此处只比较这三项指标，未判断配方整体合格。页面为示例资料的整理展示，非实时运行结果。</p></details>
  </div>
  <div class="decision-next"><span class="step-label">04 / 你来决定</span><div><h3>先补测 F-03 的耐擦洗？</h3><p>已有数据和缺项放在一起，下一轮实验由你安排。</p></div><span class="decision-owner">待研发人员确认</span></div>
</section>

